      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the password reset flow for a local account using an external provider, I will use the AWS Cognito service. AWS Cognito is a concrete external provider that can handle user authentication and password reset flows. I will import the necessary AWS SDK and use the Cognito client to initiate the password reset process. </thinking>\n",
