      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `refresh_session.py` that refreshes an expired session or access token using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a provider and use its specific API or SDK. I will use Google's OAuth2 service as the external provider, which is a widely used and well-documented service for handling authentication and authorization. I will import the necessary modules from the `google-auth` library, which is the official Python library for Google's OAuth2 service. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
